Conventions decision page template
title end

paragraph start
A decision page records one choice and why, so it can be understood years later. It uses the decision file type, which requires Context, Options, Decision and Consequences in that order.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Write the rejected options and what gets harder, because that is what is forgotten first.
paragraph end

